.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-access\-token <access_token>
Access token to send instead of the one rclone holds.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-debug
Enable debug output.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-j, \-\-json
Print the file resources as Google sends them.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-n, \-\-limit <limit>
Maximum number of files to report.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-\-rclone\-config <rclone_config>
Configuration file rclone reads. Defaults to the one rclone reports.
.UNINDENT
.INDENT 0.0
.TP
.B \-s, \-\-since <since>
Report only what changed after this. A duration (30m, 2h, 7d) or a timestamp (2026\-09\-01T08:00).
.UNINDENT
