.sp
On exit, notifications will be enabled. This command does nothing if notifications are already
disabled.
.sp
This is an alternative to \fBkde\-inhibit\fP\&. Unlike \fBkde\-inhibit\fP, this tool may only sleep.
A sleep time of \fB0\fP effectively does nothing.
